 "remarks": "This recently renovated 2nd floor 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment showcases an inviting open-concept layout, boasting gleaming hardwood floors, recessed lighting that accentuate its modern aesthetic. The modern kitchen and renovated bathroom are sure to impress! Kitchen also leads out to a private backyard area. Two spacious bedrooms adorned with recessed lighting. Abundant parking ensures convenience for residents and guests alike, while the oversized unfinished basement offers ample storage space and a dedicated laundry area, enhancing practicality and organization. Situated on a quiet street, this residence offers proximity to scenic waterfronts, parks, bustling downtown Stamford, and convenient access to the train station and I-95 for commuting. Enjoy the amenities in Old Greenwich - also just a few minutes down the road. **New water heater installed in September '25, and 4 window AC units will be included **",
